{"id":"0eac044a1f4aee4d","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-thm-L-definability.md","title":"L Definability","display":"thm-L-definability — L Definability","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-L-definability","aliases":["58-thm-L-definability","L Definability","Constructible Definability"],"display":"thm-L-definability — L Definability","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-L-definability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-L-definability</span><span>L Definability</span><span>Constructible Definability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-L-definability — L Definability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md\">../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"715a32e91161b34f\" href=\"?note=715a32e91161b34f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md\">../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\">\\(\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\)</span> (parameter-free formula in the language of membership with one free variable)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{L_\\in}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{L_\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (canonical free-variable operation and metatheoretic satisfaction)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}definability} \\vdash \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\theta)=\\{v_0\\}\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\theta[v_0\\mapsto x])\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}definability} \\vdash \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\theta)=\\{v_0\\}\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\theta[v_0\\mapsto x])\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is parameter-free first-order definability of the class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> in the ambient universe; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta\">\\(\\theta\\)</span> is a fixed formula code, not an untyped predicate variable.</li>\n<li>“Parameter-free” concerns parameters, not the signature: the formula still belongs to the language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\in\">\\(L_\\in\\)</span> and may use membership.</li>\n<li>The hierarchy is given by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_0=\\emptyset\">\\(L_0=\\emptyset\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\alpha)\">\\(L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\alpha)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha\">\\(L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha&lt;\\lambda}L_\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>The displayed satisfaction notation is metatheoretic; it does not assert the existence of a truth predicate for all formulas in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md","status":"resolved","id":"715a32e91161b34f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-free-variable.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (constructible universe, see [[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{FV}_{L_\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}L\\text{-}definability} \\vdash \\exists\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(L_\\in)\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{FV}_{L_\\in}(\\theta)=\\{v_0\\}\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;(x\\in L\\leftrightarrow(V,\\in)\\models_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\theta[v_0\\mapsto x])\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"L_0=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"L_{\\alpha+1}=\\mathrm{Def}(L_\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"L_\\lambda=\\bigcup_{\\alpha<\\lambda}L_\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1648,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4267","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-thm-L-definability.md|58-thm-L-definability]]（batch11）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-134","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-thm-0-sharp.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-condensation.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-definability.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-generic-extension.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-is-transitive.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-GCH.md]]\n[[58-thm-L-satisfies-ZFC.md]]\n[[58-thm-MM.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equal-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-V-equals-L.md]]\n[[58-thm-absoluteness-calculation.md]]\n[[58-thm-ac-wellorder-equivalent.md]]\n[[58-thm-aleph-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-completeness.md]]\n[[58-thm-analytic-set-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category-theory.md]]\n[[58-thm-baire-category.md]]\n[[58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]\n[[58-thm-beth-function-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-boolean-valued-model.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-thm-borel-determinacy-proof.md]]\n[[58-thm-bounded-forcing-axioms.md]]\n[[58-thm-cantor.md]]\n[[58-thm-cardinal-multiplication.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-filter-properties.md]]\n[[58-thm-club-guessing.md]]\n[[58-t